  "series": "Hasta Mudra Series",
  "comments": "<p><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/5dda6a4b1fcfd.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/5dda6a4b1fcfd.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a><br>There is a <strong>variation in the 2009 Mumbai mint</strong> 2 rupees coin.<br>The 1st image has a thin 9 in the year 2009.<br><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/5fb5ba54dfbf4.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/5fb5ba54dfbf4.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a><br>The 2nd image has a broad 9 in the year 2009.<br><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/5fb5ba6ccc29d.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/5fb5ba6ccc29d.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a><br>This is a combined image of the 2 coins.<br><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/5fb5ba939e9c5.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/5fb5ba939e9c5.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a><br>Die varieties in 2007 Hyderabad mint coins with Small (left) and Large (right) mint marks.<br><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/60524fec65773.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/60524fec65773.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a></p><p>I have found a grooved edge, on the 2010 Hyderabad coin: <a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/691390ea95eb9.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/691390ea95eb9.jpg\"></a> (Compared with normal edge)</p>",
